---
/* The legal footer for the pages where money is decided or shown.
 *
 * WHY THIS IS A COMPONENT AND NOT FOUR COPIES
 * Stripe requires a reachable privacy policy and terms of service from the page
 * that sells, and the requirement is not satisfied by having the documents
 * somewhere on the site — they must be reachable from where the decision is
 * made. Four hand-written copies would drift, and the one that drifted would be
 * the one nobody looked at again.
 *
 * WHY IT ALSO NAMES THE SELLER
 * The person paying should be able to see who they are paying before they pay,
 * not first discover the name on a card statement. An unrecognised descriptor is
 * one of the most common causes of a chargeback, and a chargeback from someone
 * who simply forgot is a fee and a dispute over an $8.99 subscription.
 *
 * The links carry `data-i18n-href` so the Spanish menus land on the Spanish
 * documents (/es/privacidad, /es/terminos, /es/cookies) rather than dropping a
 * Spanish reader into English legal text — which is the one place in the app
 * where the wrong language is not merely awkward.
 */
---

<div class="lgf">
  <p class="lgf-links">
    <a href="/privacy" data-i18n-href="/es/privacidad" data-i18n="nav.privacy">Privacy</a>
    <span aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
    <a href="/terms" data-i18n-href="/es/terminos" data-i18n="nav.terms">Terms</a>
    <span aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
    <a href="/cookies" data-i18n-href="/es/cookies" data-i18n="nav.cookies">Cookies</a>
    <span aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
    <a href="/help" data-i18n-href="/es/ayuda" data-i18n="nav.help">Help &amp; support</a>
  </p>
  <p class="lgf-seller" data-i18n="legal.seller">
    Declare &amp; Believe is a product of JC Kingdom Ventures, LLC.
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .lgf {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 40px auto 0;
    padding: 22px 16px 4px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line, rgba(34, 56, 46, .08));
    text-align: center;
  }
  .lgf-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px 10px;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .lgf-links a {
    color: var(--text2, #465A50);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
    padding-bottom: 1px;
    transition: color .15s ease, border-color .15s ease;
  }
  .lgf-links a:hover { color: var(--text, #22382E); border-bottom-color: currentColor; }
  .lgf-links a:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--text2, #465A50);
    outline-offset: 3px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .lgf-links span { color: var(--muted, #7E8E84); }
  .lgf-seller {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--muted, #7E8E84);
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .lgf-links a { transition: none; }
  }
</style>
